<title>INDIA: India's NIIT 95/96 net up 43 pct.</title>
<headline>India's NIIT 95/96 net up 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit		479.92  vs    336.14</p>
<p>    Net revenue	   2,284.18  vs  1,496.99</p>
<p>    Other income	     74.39  vs     26.83</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   1,618.08  vs  1,020.20</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  133.98  vs     53.97</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    102.61  vs    103.52</p>
<p>    Provision for tax	24.00  vs     10.00</p>
<p>NOTE: NITT Ltd is a leading company in the field of computer software education. The company, which is a part of the HCL group, also has interests in computer services consultancy.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
